    },
    "Take “%@” down?" : {
      "comment" : "Compose project: stop and remove its containers and networks (`compose down`)"
    },
    "That’s OrbStack’s. New terminals will use Basket’s docker; OrbStack’s stays at %@." : {

    },
    "The OrbStack container is running and holds %@. Stop it in OrbStack before starting the Basket copy, or change the ports." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der OrbStack-Container läuft und belegt %@. Stoppe ihn in OrbStack, bevor du die Kopie in Basket startest, oder ändere die Ports."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le conteneur OrbStack est en cours d’exécution et occupe %@. Arrêtez-le dans OrbStack avant de démarrer la copie Basket, ou changez les ports."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OrbStackのコンテナが実行中で、%@を使用しています。Basketのコピーを起動する前にOrbStackでコンテナを停止するか、ポートを変更してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OrbStack 中的容器正在运行并占用了 %@。请先在 OrbStack 中停止它，再启动 Basket 中的副本，或者更改端口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OrbStack 容器正在執行並佔用 %@。請先在 OrbStack 中停止它，再啟動 Basket 中的拷貝，或更改連接埠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VM can use up to this much memory; most containers need far less than %@." : {

    },
    "The `container` CLI was not found (looked in %@). Install it with `brew install container`." : {
      "localizations" : {
